        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-a-list-and-a-random-pick-16-985cb86f-2041-43cb-b46f-bc7e42276b04",
        "text": "###A list holds the options.\nAsk AI to store your lunch choices in a **list**, so your website can use them.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/1cd0aa02fc4d84dac6ab68bc2cbd9d1d-panel-1-options-compact.gif",
