        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-a-list-and-a-random-pick-16-3be0c95d-6b6f-4966-a2b7-26df6e11886e",
        "text": "####A random pick chooses one by chance.\nAsk AI to make the button randomly select one item from your list when clicked.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/5a3e5e587fd1a043fdb2a3676ea2bb22-panel-2-gentle-random-pick.gif",
