      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-a-list-and-a-random-pick-16-3c876579-7669-4811-8c2f-96dd4256a84e",
        "text": "####An animation shows the action.\nAsk AI to add a spinning animation that ends on the selected item. The random pick decides the result; the animation reveals it.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/67316089bddc74a3a5ce74d24d2aa9f4-panel-3-spin-stop-pizza.gif",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Learn about lists and random picks. Understand that a list holds options, a random pick chooses one by chance, and visual effects like spinning wheels are just for appearance.",
